port: lyrics provider registry + LRC provider adapter (Phase 5 — partial)

Android `lyrics/LyricsProviderRegistry.kt` + `lyrics/LyricsProvider.kt` ported to
`lib/services/lyrics_registry.dart`:

- `LyricsProvider` interface (name, `getLyrics`).
- `LyricsProviderRegistry`: `providerNames`, `providerDisplayNames`,
  `defaultOrder` (Android order, LrcLib first — desktop has only LRC so far),
  `chooseProvider(order, outcomes) → ProviderSelection(name?, pending, none)`.
- `lib/services/lyrics_provider_lrc.dart` — desktop adapter of Android's
  `LrcLibLyricsProvider` over the existing `getLRCNetAPILyrics` (`lrcnet_api.dart`).
- `LyricsService.getLyrics` delegates to `getLRCNetAPILyrics`; added
  `LyricsService.getProviderNames()` (registry).
- Tests: `test/lyrics_registry_test.dart` (5 cases).

Not ported yet (deep-parity, budget-bound): BetterLyrics, SimpMusic, YouLyPlus,
Kugou, Paxsenix, Unison, YouTubeSubtitle, YouTube Music.

Verified: `flutter analyze` 0 errors, `flutter test` 25/25, `flutter build
windows --debug` → echo.exe.
